    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sub-sĕro</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, sertum, 3,
				v. a., <i>to put</i> or <i>insert under</i> (late Lat.). * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subsertis manibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 200, 23</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res monuit super Eutherio pauca subserere,</span>”
				<i>to add</i>, <i>subjoin</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 16, 7, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">14, 11, 3</span></i>.</div>
